---
description: >-
  `actor`-keyword participants that carry an inline `"alias"` field inside
  the `@{...}` metadata object rather than using the external `as` syntax,
  covering actor, boundary, and control stereotypes.
config:
  look: classic
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor U@{ "type" : "actor", "alias": "End User" }
  actor G@{ "type" : "boundary", "alias": "Gateway" }
  actor S@{ "type" : "control", "alias": "Service" }
  U ->> G: Request
  G ->> S: Process
  S -->> G: Response
  G -->> U: Result
